{"tabName":"Inside your network (what you control)","graphs":[
  {
    graphStyle: "markdown",
    markdown: "These tables show **internal entities** (Corelight observed them as a local host) that exceeded performance thresholds. These are systems where you likely have purview: your DNS resolvers, your TLS / HTTP servers, your clients, your high-volume hosts.\n\nRanking is by **crossings**; **crossing rate** normalizes by activity; **worst latency (s)** shows the worst single-window observation.",
    title: "Inside your network \u2014 what you can fix",
    layout: {
  h: 7,
  w: 60,
  x: 0,
  y: 0
}
  },
  {
    description: "DNS response time aggregated by resolver IP (trigger DS, local_entity=true).",
